# (0.14) The Desktop's new functions (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py makes tests/desk14.keys from
# this; the card gets /GAME.ATR, a copy of a disk image of the test tree). Files is at
# (24, 24); its rows: BLUE.XEX y 146, GAME.ATR 158, LONG.TXT 170, README.TXT 182. Shots (s):
#   1  16.0  File > Add to desktop on LONG.TXT, README.TXT dragged from Files onto the
#            desktop: two shortcuts (the arrow), README.TXT's where it was dropped
#   2  21.5  BLUE.XEX and GAME.ATR dragged from Files onto the Atari icon: mounted (the green
#            mark; the disk on D2: as the executable is D1:); the Atari icon clicked: the panel
#   3  23.0  the panel's Eject for the program (Files' footer follows)
#   4  24.5  Eject all: nothing loaded
#   5  28.0  the clock clicked: "Date and time", 2026-11-17 14:05 typed
#   6  29.5  Enter: the bar shows 14:05
#   7  33.0  the SD card icon dragged to the left of the desktop (snapped to the grid)
#   8  34.5  a right click on the desktop: its pop-up menu (0.15: New folder..., Tidy up, -,
#            Settings...; above the pointer: no room below)
#   9  36.0  Tidy up: every icon back in order
#  10  38.0  a right click on the README.TXT shortcut: Open, Show original, -, Rename...,
#            Delete (0.15; left of the pointer: no room at the right)
#  11  39.5  Delete: the confirmation
#  12  41.0  Enter: the shortcut is gone
#  13  45.0  Horizon > About Horizon: the date
